-- WDOS migration 022 · Every country, so a woman anywhere can register (diaspora: Country, then State or Province, then City, then Chapter).
-- Adds the 162 countries and territories of the ISO 3166 list that WDOS did not hold yet. The 81 already there are untouched.
-- Their states, provinces and cities are static lists under assets/geo/world and are not database rows.
-- Data impact: new rows in org_units only. No member, chapter or seat changes. Safe to run twice: a country already present is skipped.
-- Rollback: DELETE FROM org_units WHERE level='country' AND id > (the highest country id before this migration) AND no member, chapter or seat points at it.
